== Trivia ==
* This item is a reference to the fairy Navi in the [[wikipedia:The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time|The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time]], who guides the player during the game with the catchphrase, "HEY, LISTEN."
** The item name and description both being “Yo listen!” is a joke about how frequently Navi interrupts the player, to the point of annoyance.
* {{I|MEAT!}}, {{I|YO LISTEN!}}, {{I|PHD}}, [[G FUEL!]] and {{I|TMTRAINER}} are the only '''ALL CAPS''' items in the game.

